2922:- Decided: `docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html` (version 2.15) is the extraction step's PRD and the one source of the draft standard; its rules are those of `standard-v2.14.md`, which it supersedes, and it adds the golden set's results (§8) and how a prompt change is written, measured and iterated (§9, pointing to AGENTS.md). Its status is unchanged by this decision: a draft until Alex decides its twelve proposals; until then the signed standard (D229) is the only ruler and no prompt changes (D241). AGENTS.md §8 points to the page; §6 (writing prompts) and §7 (measuring and iterating, split into the ruler, reading results and iterating) carry the principles that were missed in earlier rounds, each with Alex's words or the incident behind it; outdated statements were removed (the design-phase "no product code" rule, a function that no longer exists, the old glossary section name). Two principles quote Alex's words from earlier the same day, recorded here as their source: on iterating, "你一类一类改，快速迭代然后测regression"; on self-graded measurement, "你的这个垃圾代码和尺子根本就是fucking cancer 我根本无法相信你的评价". The same AGENTS.md is in both worktrees. The README of each branch describes that branch. A read-only Codex review checked the rewrite against the old file and the decisions, and the page against v2.14 (`review-agents-rewrite.md`, `review-page-v2.15.md`); its confirmed findings were fixed, among them a D240 rule written stronger than Alex's words, a calibration step he never asked for, and 49 golden entries without speaker or meaning, now filled from the text.
2924:## D243 · 2026-10-29 · The extraction standard is signed: proposal 5 stricter, the other eleven at their leans; lean cautious, catch the increment
2953:## D248 · 2026-10-30 · What counts as one question and one piece of evidence: seven boundaries, chosen one by one
2971:- Decided (the method, written at AGENTS §6): from role-v59 the extraction request ends with a check that reads the evidence list back by standard 5.1 (`prompts/review-v<N>.txt`, `extraction.REVIEW_FROM`) and names no empty-answer condition; the role text of role-v59 to role-v63 is role-v53's. Every line of the check cites the standard (§5.1, §5.3, §6, D238, D243, D240); six read-only Codex rounds (`research/2026-10-30-noise/codex-review-*`); examples from other industries.
2975:## D250 · 2026-10-31 · Four evidence boundaries and the counting unit settled; the ruler is fixed before any further measurement (standard version 5)
2979:  1. **An arrangement retold without a new step** (Nokia AI-RAN collaboration, a carmaker's model on the platform, labs using a system): the lean as put: "只描述一个现成安排、没有新动作的，算背景，不收". An arrangement the item only describes as already in place (a collaboration, a customer using a product, a deployment), with no new step, is background and not kept, even when the item gives no date; everything else under the retelling row (D243 item 6, "看不出是旧事的不算重提") is judged as before, and guidance and a forecast or plan still in force keep their weight when retold.
2984:- The ruler (Alex: "你要修正尺子"): the standard page goes to version 5 with these rules, then a read-only drift review; the gold's evidence part is re-derived for version 5 (version 4 changed no evidence entry, `gold-v4-evidence-check.md`) by two independent readers with every disagreement decided against the article, written as a new frozen file with every change listed (before, after, reason), the version-3 file untouched (D243 item 11); the opening part of the gold is not re-derived here and the scorer reports no question score until it is. The scorer refuses a gold whose evidence part was made for another version of the page: `final_scores.py` had bypassed `score_gold.py`'s version check and scored rounds since D248 on the version-3 gold, which is the false measurement Alex names.

