vidence by default / link only what a thesis directly concerns, omit the rest) with one decidable rule, and the request's closing line no longer invites an empty answer (extraction.EMPTY_LINE_FROM). The admission reasons stay v12's. Version 12 (D184, 2026-10-26): identical entries to version 11; the version exists because the extraction schema gains the admission fields (opens_as, folds_into, lost_if_folded, settled_by; code, extraction.admission_schema) and role-v12 states the four reasons a candidate may open. Version 10 (D167, 2026-10-25): identical to version 9; the version exists because the extraction schema's measure vocabulary gains market_size and project_cost (code, extraction.MEASURES_V10), so requests under v10 differ from v9 and the archive keeps them apart. 05-extraction.md: block 2 (what this category is and how to read it, from the classification rules) and block 4 (what to read out of it), same entries as categories-v6; version 9: declared groups carry aliases so code decides group identity and membership (D166); research groups only for ongoing matters, not for a company's own financial lines (D149/D164). Enum values come from the response schema.",
src/hivemind/prompts/categories-v62.json:2: "_note": "Version 62 (2026-10-31, arm on version 53, D244): entries identical to version 53; role-v62 (noise class, loop log row 44): role text identical to role-v53; review-v62.txt is review-v61.txt plus one guard sentence carrying standard \u00a76 core definition (touches revenue, profit, financing or credit risk, demand, the main product's progress or key inputs' supply and price, and carries a figure, a settled state or a forecast for a stated period: never dropped). Version 53 (2026-10-30, arm on version 51, D244): entries identical to version 51; role-v53 (record-field class): the role text is role-v51's unchanged; the definitions of speaker, original_who and original_day (role-v52's sentence, split per field) travel in the schema as field descriptions (extraction.FIELD_NOTES, FIELD_NOTES_FROM = 53). Tests whether role-v52's rise in gold-rejected statements kept came from writing the definitions inside the role text that decides what to keep. Version 51 (2026-10-29, arm on version 42, D244): entries identical to version 42; main_driver's product branch written as the page's \u00a73 B row (the generation that carries the company's value, launch or first shipment) with one example and one counter-example (\u00a75.3 product-detail row). Version 42 (2026-10-29, arm on version 41, D244): entries identical to version 41; role-v42 (arm A8, on v41): the page's boundary column added to the checked list (5.3): a partner's or customer's adoption or integration, and a change to the plan, configuration or timing of the product that carries the company's value, are not product details; an official's order, law, bill or ruling is kind (4), not a political view; kind (2) keeps a counterparty's reported figure (5.1 kind 2); two surplus examples cut. v41 had dropped exactly these against a simultaneous control. Version 41 (2026-10-29, arm on version 36, D244): entries identical to version 36; role-v41 (arm A7, on v36): structure only,